{"id":"3bcf14b20009dcce","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-phase-kickback.md","title":"Phase Oracle from Reversible Evaluation","display":"lem-phase-kickback — Phase Oracle from Reversible Evaluation","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-phase-kickback","aliases":["28-lem-phase-kickback"],"display":"lem-phase-kickback — Phase Oracle from Reversible Evaluation","depends_on":["[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, reflection implementation","source_printed_pages":"218","source_pdf_pages":"244","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-phase-kickback"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-phase-kickback</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-phase-kickback — Phase Oracle from Reversible Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f7c978c7cd80eed3\" href=\"?note=f7c978c7cd80eed3\" title=\"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle\">28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.4, reflection implementation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"218"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"244"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_f\">\\(U_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f7c978c7cd80eed3\" href=\"?note=f7c978c7cd80eed3\" title=\"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle\">28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\operatorname{diag}(1,-1)\">\\(Z=\\operatorname{diag}(1,-1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|{-}\\rangle=(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)/\\sqrt2\">\\(|{-}\\rangle=(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)/\\sqrt2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi=\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\alpha_x|x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\">\\(\\psi=\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\alpha_x|x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_x\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(\\alpha_x\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为该空间恒等算子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_f\">\\(O_f\\)</span> 为以下基作用唯一线性延拓的算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_f|x\\rangle\\coloneqq(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_f|x\\rangle\\coloneqq(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_f(\\psi\\otimes|{-}\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|{-}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_f(\\psi\\otimes|{-}\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|{-}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_f(I\\otimes Z)U_f(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|0\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_f(I\\otimes Z)U_f(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|0\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按f(x)=0或1检查单个基态即可：异或位翻转对负态产生符号，或“计算、相位、反计算”将辅助位复原。再由线性性推广。第二式直接对应原书实现，第一式是同一变换的等价局部推导。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4, reflection implementation；印刷页 218；PDF 页 244。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第10章的 Phase Oracle from Reversible Evaluation，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"f7c978c7cd80eed3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"f7c978c7cd80eed3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$U_f$ 见 [[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_f","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\operatorname{diag}(1,-1)","display":false},{"tex":"|{-}\\rangle=(|0\\rangle-|1\\rangle)/\\sqrt2","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi=\\sum_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\alpha_x|x\\rangle\\in\\mathbb C^{\\{0,1\\}^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_x\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"O_f","display":false},{"tex":"O_f|x\\rangle\\coloneqq(-1)^{f(x)}|x\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"U_f(\\psi\\otimes|{-}\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|{-}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"U_f(I\\otimes Z)U_f(\\psi\\otimes|0\\rangle)=(O_f\\psi)\\otimes|0\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":1843,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-tensor-product-state]]、[[28-df-hadamard-transform]]、[[28-df-reversible-boolean-oracle]]、[[28-lem-phase-kickback]]、[[28-df-grover-iterate]]、[[28-thm-grover-success-amplitude]]、[[28-df-simon-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-quantum-fourier-transform]]、[[28-lem-nontrivial-square-root-factor]]。"}],"outgoing":["f7c978c7cd80eed3"]}